            "enable_padding": true
          }
        },
        "template--15922140283018__aa4bb5d3-2c94-4cc5-a4a0-67fa7bb9b8c2-content-2": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "MARY RAND",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is your favorite Thread product and why?<\/strong><\/p><p>I use the Vertical Wallet with a Wrist Lanyard to hold all my cards, I put my car keys on the Neck Lanyard. I put all of that in the Fanny Pack and wear it as a cross body, and then I use the Tote for bigger stuff like my computer, water bottle, sweatshirt, & farmers market goods.<br\/><br\/><strong>What does Carry On mean to me?<\/strong><\/p><p>Carry On means to practicing the ability to move through life with connection, compassion, confidence & clarity given the different obstacles that we all face. Key word there is practice.<\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image0_1.jpg",
            "button_label": "Button",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-overlay-1 color__text",
            "color_border": "!color__border-transparent",
            "color_text": "color__dark",
            "color_button": "btn btn--secondary",
            "enable_gradient": false,
            "layout_y_alignment": "items-start",
            "layout_x_alignment": "",
            "layout_desktop_width": 4,
