          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ivy Miller",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is your favorite Thread product and why?<\/strong><\/p><p>I love the Mini Backpack, I can fit just about everything in it. I've taken it on the plane and to events. It's so versatile & perfect for everything!<br\/><br\/><strong>What does Carry On mean to me?<\/strong><\/p><p>Carry On means to accept the roller-coaster of good and bad, light and dark, fun and boring, learning and celebrating—polarity of life.<\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image0_1_25566dfc-d1ca-4d74-be7e-3a406f1acd1c.jpg",
            "button_label": "Button",
