          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "JACK SOREN",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is your favorite Thread product and why?<\/strong><\/p><p>I dig the Crossbody, I like to keep all my nicknacks on me. Always got the small essentials on me.<br\/><br\/><strong>What does Carry On mean to me?<\/strong><\/p><p>Win or lose, I'll still be doing my thing. No matter what comes, keep pushing, keep moving forward.<\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_3738.jpg",
